@startuml
' Super admin sequence diagram for VibeCraft
skinparam backgroundColor #F8F3FF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #6D28D9
  LifeLineBorderColor #8B5CF6
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F5F3FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #7C3AED
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F3E8FF
  ActorBorderColor #7C3AED
  ActorBackgroundColor #EDE9FE
  BoxBorderColor #7C3AED
  BoxBackgroundColor #F8F3FF
  MessageAlign center
}

actor SuperAdmin
participant Browser
participant AdminLoginPage
participant AdminDashboard
participant UserModel
participant AchievementService
participant RankingService
participant NotificationService

SuperAdmin -> Browser: Open /admin/login
Browser -> AdminLoginPage: Load admin login form
SuperAdmin -> AdminLoginPage: Submit credentials

alt Credentials valid and role = super_admin
    AdminLoginPage -> UserModel: Authenticate admin account
    UserModel --> AdminLoginPage: Admin confirmed
    AdminLoginPage -> Browser: Redirect to /admin
    Browser -> AdminDashboard: Load global admin dashboard
    AdminDashboard -> UserModel: Fetch system metrics and users
    UserModel --> AdminDashboard: Admin data
    AdminDashboard -> SuperAdmin: Display dashboard
else Invalid credentials
    AdminLoginPage -> SuperAdmin: Show login error and retry
else Role mismatch
    AdminLoginPage -> Browser: Redirect to home
    Browser -> SuperAdmin: Access denied fallback
end

SuperAdmin -> AdminDashboard: Open leaderboards and platform overview
AdminDashboard -> RankingService: Recompute rankings
RankingService -> UserModel: Update current_rank and previous_rank
UserModel --> RankingService: Rank data saved
RankingService --> AdminDashboard: Rankings refreshed

SuperAdmin -> AdminDashboard: Trigger achievement evaluation
AdminDashboard -> AchievementService: Evaluate achievements for users
AchievementService -> UserModel: Check XP and milestones
UserModel --> AchievementService: Achievement state
AchievementService --> AdminDashboard: Awards issued or skipped

alt No achievement conditions met
    AchievementService -> SuperAdmin: No new awards to assign
else New awards unlocked
    AchievementService -> NotificationService: Send user notifications
    NotificationService -> SuperAdmin: Notify system update complete
end

SuperAdmin -> AdminDashboard: Review system health
AdminDashboard -> UserModel: Query pending users and campus activity
UserModel --> AdminDashboard: Summary data
AdminDashboard -> SuperAdmin: Show monitoring results

alt Data unavailable
    AdminDashboard -> SuperAdmin: Show empty-state fallback
end
@enduml
